# Stage 1 far layer (factor 3/16 ~ 0.2, y = 0): the Untersberg massif, a long
# flat-topped limestone plateau with a cliff band under the rim (F with lit f
# buttresses), a sheer east face in shadow, and summer snow traces (h). Haze
# dithers the foot into h. Colours f F h only (art-style 7). Drawn by the
# pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid below is the source.
sprite = bg_untersberg
size   = 640x120
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
